{"id":"37b6b6dcccf0b425","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class.md","title":"ZFC Setop Equivalence Class","display":"df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class — ZFC Setop Equivalence Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class"],"display":"df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class — ZFC Setop Equivalence Class","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class — ZFC Setop Equivalence Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,E,C,a\\in V\">\\(X,E,C,a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopEquivalenceClass}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopEquivalenceClass}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopEquivalenceClass}_S(C,a,E,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land a\\in X\n\\land C=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopEquivalenceClass}_S(C,a,E,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land a\\in X\n\\land C=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The base set is explicit, so the class is a set and cannot accidentally collect objects outside the field of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,E,C,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopEquivalenceClass}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopEquivalenceClass}_S(C,a,E,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land a\\in X\n\\land C=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":960,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class.md|58-df-zfc-setop-equivalence-class]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","908bc7b079f5d25b"]}